{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52214","headline":"颂六十二首 三十九 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 三十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六情无福志，四摄啓幽心。\n俭约避人物，偃息慕山林。\n曲𡼏停驺响，交枝落慢阴\n池台聚冻雪，檐牖参归禽。\n石来无新故，峯形讵古今。\n大车何杳杳，奔马送駸駸。\n何以修六念，虔诚枉一音。\n未泛慈舟宝，徒劳抒海深。\n（见同书卷五九《俭约篇》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52214.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52214","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}